+      "q": "How does the SOS feature work?",
+      "a": "Tapping SOS immediately alerts your Trusted Contacts with your live location and notifies our 24/7 internal security team."
+    },
+    "f9": {
+      "q": "Are the companions identity-verified?",
+      "a": "Yes! Look for the blue tick badge. This means they have completed a strict KYC process including Govt ID verification."
+    },
+    "f10": {
+      "q": "Can I hide my profile?",
